    "name": "Latex-resume generator",
    "description": "## Latex Resume Generator API\n\nThis collection covers the API endpoints for a **LaTeX-based resume generation service** running locally at `http://localhost:8080`. The service compiles LaTeX source into PDF resumes and exposes supporting endpoints for usage tracking, monitoring, and real-time compilation via WebSockets.\n\n### Endpoints Overview\n\n| Request | Method | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Health** | GET | Check the health/availability of the service |\n| **pdf binary** | POST | Submit LaTeX source to `/api/compile` and receive a compiled PDF binary |\n| **Websockets** | GET | Connect to `/api/compile/ws` for real-time, streaming LaTeX compilation |\n| **Visiters** | POST | Record a visitor event for usage tracking |\n| **Download** | GET | Log or retrieve download statistics |\n| **Stats** | GET | Retrieve overall usage statistics |\n| **Dashboard** | GET | Fetch aggregated stats for a monitoring dashboard |\n| **Prometheos** | GET | Expose Prometheus-compatible metrics at `/metrics` for observability |\n\n### Base URL\n\n```\nhttp://localhost:8080\n\n ```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "37687945"
  },
